---

### 2. `config/backup.conf.example`
```bash
# Example configuration for Automated Backup & Integrity Verifier
# Copy this file to config/backup.conf and update values for your environment.

# Space-separated list of directories to back up
SOURCE_DIRS="/var/www/app-data /etc/nginx"

# Destination directory for backup archives and checksums
BACKUP_DIR="/var/backups/verifier"

# Log file path
LOG_FILE="/var/log/backup_verifier.log"

# Number of days to keep older backup archives
RETENTION_DAYS=14

# Optional webhook URL for failure notifications (leave empty to disable)
ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=""
